1
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 13=

3
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,479
Who are you?

4
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,840
How did you know we would come?

5
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:00,079
This illusion is a game I designed.

6
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,719
One life for another.

7
00:01:03,439 --> 00:01:04,680
That is the only way out.

8
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:08,920
It's been years since anyone dared

9
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,239
to truly embrace
the art of dying to live.

10
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,640
To take that one step with no return.

11
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:16,120
Who are you?

12
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,400
Yin Chuan.

13
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,439
You are...

14
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,400
the ancient demon.

15
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,480
Yin Chuan.

16
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:30,719
Elder.

17
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,200
We came here

18
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,879
to find the Divine Stone.

19
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,040
The Divine Stone

20
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,560
is not here.

21
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,000
Back then,

22
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,439
the Divine Stone
of the Demon Lord Hundun

23
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:46,400
was struck down by the Wind God Feilian.

24
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,959
Humans fought over it.

25
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,760
Blood ran like rivers.

26
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,640
I crossed the heavenly tribulation
to find it,

27
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:54,040
but my Essence was shattered.

28
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,879
I have been trapped in this barrier
ever since.

29
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:58,280
A mountain woman saved me.

30
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:02,040
This illusion was made for her
to come and go freely.

31
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,480
After she left, I changed the rules

32
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,400
to keep others from finding this place.

33
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,959
Any intruder

34
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,680
must offer their spiritual energy
and blood

35
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:13,080
to help me recover.

36
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:14,159
That mountain woman...

37
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,479
she was Fengniang, wasn't she?

38
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,560
When she left,

39
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,599
I planted this tree.

40
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,759
Now it stands tall and full.

41
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,360
If you miss her,

42
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:30,800
why not go find her?

43
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,960
Thoughts drift with the wind.

44
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,080
My heart stays still.

45
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,120
Knowing she is well

46
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,080
is enough.

47
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,199
Whether she's well or not

48
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,360
is none of our concern.

49
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,240
Only she and you can know the answer.

50
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,599
Since you have passed my trial,

51
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,400
you may leave.

52
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,360
Do not tell anyone else

53
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,520
that I am at this place.

54
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,719
Hmm.

55
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:05,680
Let's go.

56
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:06,560
Let's depart.

57
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:08,719
You...

58
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,280
Wait a moment.

59
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,639
I...

60
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,560
(He can use Spirit-Calling Art?)

61
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:37,919
I've been putting on
quite a show this whole time.

62
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:44,000
Hahaha!

63
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:47,319
Yin Chuan, the ancient demon.

64
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:48,919
cannot be defeated by spells.

65
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,439
But the sound of the Demon Flute
turns it to stone.

66
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,759
What are you doing?

67
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,439
Of course

68
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,759
I am taking the Divine Stone.

69
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,039
Ziyan.

70
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:02,879
Hold on.

71
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,159
You have to hold on.

72
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,720
The Demon-Slaying Pen
is forged with special materials

73
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,560
and secret techniques.

74
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,680
Any demon it wounds

75
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,959
will have its blood

76
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:33,319
reveal its true demonic color.

77
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,920
The Divine Stone can take human form.

78
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,519
Its purple demonic essence is unique
in both realms.

79
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:46,079
And its blood shimmers the same purple.

80
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,000
She

81
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,639
is the Divine Stone itself.

82
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:53,560
Hahaha!

83
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,000
Oh.

84
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:00,920
I have waited all these years

85
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,199
just for this moment.

86
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:05,720
This is the Divine Stone
that can elevate anyone to godhood!

87
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,199
And you...

88
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:11,720
So you wanted to use love

89
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:13,720
to keep her for yourself.

90
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,279
How righteous of you.

91
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,639
The one who defiled love

92
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,279
is you!

93
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,279
Ziyan.

94
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,399
We killed him.

95
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,680
Xuanwu Sect will come for us.

96
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,399
I'll go get some food.

97
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,040
Now that

98
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:15,959
you all know I am the Divine Stone.

99
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:23,399
Demon, human,

100
00:06:23,879 --> 00:06:24,920
or the Divine Stone,

101
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,360
I'll take your hand

102
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,480
through joy and pain.

103
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,160
We will never part.

104
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:53,560
Pesky Taoist.

105
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,160
Ah!

106
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,240
Hand in hand.

107
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,040
My name is

108
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:27,639
Shangguan Ziyan.

109
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,720
(The Divine Stone blooms.)

110
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,519
(So...)

111
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:33,320
(I have fallen for him too)

112
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,879
(without even realizing it.)

113
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:42,360
How romantic!

114
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,759
How moving!

115
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,120
But...

116
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:48,919
what about mending the sky?

117
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,039
He's revealing his demon form.

118
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:13,080
A slaughter is coming. Let's go.

119
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:15,960
I am near death.

120
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,279
Only by consuming the complete Stone

121
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,080
can I survive the heavenly tribulation.

122
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,679
Yuanchu.

123
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:44,879
Release them.

124
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,360
I will return to my true form
and give myself to you.

125
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:51,120
Interesting.

126
00:09:54,679 --> 00:09:55,480
Deal.

127
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,159
What you gave me was the Stone Curse.

128
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,440
You wanted it to drain my power,

129
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:19,200
to burn me from within.

130
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:20,720
Isn't that right?

131
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,120
How do you know about the Stone Curse?

132
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,200
Because the Stone Curse

133
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,600
was carved by me.

134
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:30,440
What did you say?

135
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:35,360
A thousand years ago, I was friends
with Hundun and Feilian.

136
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:37,200
They fought for centuries.

137
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,480
To protect Hundun,

138
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:40,519
I carved a protective spell on her.

139
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:43,039
Later, she became the Divine Stone,

140
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:48,360
and that spell became the Stone Curse.

141
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:50,879
It torments her day and night.

142
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,320
That is why I came to the Mortal Realm
to find the Divine Stone.

143
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,639
When I first saw you and him,

144
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,159
I decided to put you both to the test.

145
00:11:00,639 --> 00:11:02,679
If your love truly stood firm,

146
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:05,000
perhaps this time,

147
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:07,039
things would end differently.

148
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:10,720
And now, do you have your answer?

149
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:22,200
Ziyan.

150
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,360
Are you okay?

151
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,200
Do you know what

152
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:29,279
what happens
after the Stone mends the sky?

153
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,960
What?

154
00:11:32,879 --> 00:11:34,159
Of course, peace will come to the world.

155
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,240
The Sky Rift will be sealed.

156
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:40,279
Demons from the Void Realm
can no longer enter the mortal world.

157
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:43,720
And the Stone will remain
on the Rift forever,

158
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,759
fading into the sky.

159
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,759
Does that mean we have to kill her?

160
00:11:56,679 --> 00:12:00,639
So mending the sky means killing her.

161
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:03,080
This is your fate.

162
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,559
It was sealed from the start.

163
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,120
So now,

164
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:13,120
do you still want to help him
mend the sky?

165
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,840
I don't accept fate.

166
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,480
She is my wife.

167
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,639
We share our fate together.

168
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,039
I see.

169
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:37,639
I have my answer.

170
00:12:46,559 --> 00:12:48,480
There is one way

171
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:50,480
to use the Divine Stone to mend the sky

172
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,000
and still keep you alive.

173
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:55,480
My Demon Core.

174
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:39,480
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

175
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:42,880
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

176
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:46,400
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

177
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:49,720
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

178
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:56,640
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

179
00:13:57,240 --> 00:14:04,235
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

180
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:08,480
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

181
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:12,320
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

182
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:19,120
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
